-    (proposition3 (by simpa using hQ4)).1 (σ.restrict Q hQ) (σ'.restrict Q hQ)
-      (SpeciesTree.restrict_isBinary hσ Q hQ) (SpeciesTree.restrict_isBinary hσ' Q hQ)
-      (unrootedDist_restrict_eq h Q hQ)
-
-end ADR11
